## 3.3) Audio.cpp: печатать расширенную диагностику при `mf_res == -14`

Файл: `yoRadio/src/audioI2S/Audio.cpp`  
Внутри web microflac decode loop (в `sendBytes()`, в error path где уже есть лог):

```cpp
AUDIO_ERROR("microflac err %d (%s) cons=%u left=%u header=%u out=%u", ...)
```

Сразу после него добавить **дополнительный лог только для `mf_res == -14`** (rate-limited тем же окном, можно под тем же `if(s_errLogCnt < 5)`):

```cpp
if ((int)mf_res == -14) {
    uint32_t rp = InBuff.getReadPos();
    uint32_t wp = InBuff.getWritePos();
    uint32_t filled = (uint32_t)InBuff.bufferFilled();
    uint32_t maxAvail = (uint32_t)InBuff.getMaxAvailableBytes();
    uint32_t maxBlk = (uint32_t)InBuff.getMaxBlockSize();

    // first 8 bytes at current pointer (safe even if short)
    uint8_t b0 = (left > 0) ? p[0] : 0;
    uint8_t b1 = (left > 1) ? p[1] : 0;
    uint8_t b2 = (left > 2) ? p[2] : 0;
    uint8_t b3 = (left > 3) ? p[3] : 0;

    AUDIO_ERROR("microflac OGG_DIAG ogg_res=%d serial=%lu seq=%lu htype=%u segs=%u rp=%lu wp=%lu filled=%lu maxAvail=%lu maxBlk=%lu head=%02X %02X %02X %02X",
        (int)g_mf.get_last_ogg_result(),
        (unsigned long)g_mf.get_last_ogg_serial(),
        (unsigned long)g_mf.get_last_ogg_sequence(),
        (unsigned)g_mf.get_last_ogg_header_type(),
        (unsigned)g_mf.get_last_ogg_segment_count(),
        (unsigned long)rp, (unsigned long)wp, (unsigned long)filled,
        (unsigned long)maxAvail, (unsigned long)maxBlk,
        b0, b1, b2, b3
    );
}
